Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:27:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] M3-BPR-407/M3-ENV-714: the Ch8 fights stand on env-art's
 final arenas

ch08_stair_hold_1 -> seawall_stairhead_storm; _2 and _3 -> seawall_stairhead_hoist; undertows_reach ->
seawall_stairhead_surge; ch08_headland_gulls and _crabs -> coilspire_headland_path; ch08_flue_moths ->
coilspire_tier_landing. The three seawall arenas stage as the wall-walk did (travel_scale 0.85).
Apply after claude/env-art is merged (its arenas and arenas.json scenes).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015hKkhtpX67kS4yZeA8AAhv
